  "title": "CircuitTree and CircuitLasso for Explaining Large Language Models",
  "summary": "CircuitTree enables decomposing complex neural networks into interpretable modules, while CircuitLasso provides a scalable approach to learning sparse circuits to improve interpretability and performance.",
